  "description": [
    {
      "ja": "30MMエグザビークルシリーズに「多脚メカVer.」が登場！",
      "en": "\"Multi-legged mecha Ver.\" is now available in the 30MM EXA VEHICLE series!"
    },
    {
      "ja": "• 脚部は基部から爪先までの各関節がフレキシブルに可動。",
      "en": "• Each leg joint from the base to the toes can move flexibly."
    },
    {
      "ja": "• 背中の砲身は前脚にも装着可能。",
      "en": "• The gun barrel on the back can also be attached to the front legs."
    },
    {
      "ja": "• 本商品の胴体パーツを複数組み合わせることで延長が可能。",
      "en": "• Can be extended by combining multiple body parts of this product."
    },
    {
      "ja": "• 分解すればカスタマイズパーツとしても使用できる。",
      "en": "• Can be used as customized parts by disassembling it."
    }
